                                                "sense_id": "11583c00-0795-3bcc-bc29-37a0f546a1fc",
                                                "text": "Georgia’s election administrators are fighting bizarre conspiracy theories, ballooning costs and coronavirus-related staffing problems as they prepare for the state’s contentious, nationally watched Senate runoffs next week."
